 a market being fueled by remarkable levels of AI investment, lead times matter a lot.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/01/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2025 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Performance would have tracked even stronger if it were not for larger-than-expected pressures from two items out of our control: additional tariffs announced in August just after our Q2 earnings call, and incremental challenges sourcing rare earth magnets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/01/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2025 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2025-10-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Our associates continue to overmanage the impacts of tariffs and rare earth magnet constraints and are doing a great job working our commercial funnels to drive improved orders and performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/01/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2025 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2025-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"The way we get there is, you know, we would expect some growth or some EBITDA expansion, and then we would expect maybe another $60 to $70 million coming through working capital to help us bridge the gap a bit along with lower cash restructuring, you know, cash interest comes down.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/01/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q1","e":"rrx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"When considering margin performance versus the prior year period, the business also saw headwinds from the anticipated unfavorable tariff price cost overhang and to a lesser extent, continued rare earth magnet supply constraints, along with higher growth investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q1","e":"rrx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"Versus prior year, margins were down as expected due to the impact of tariff price cost, higher growth investments and unfavorable mix, partially offset by synergy benefits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q1","e":"rrx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Louis Pinkham","x":"Our teams overcame headwinds from mix, higher-than-anticipated inflation, tariffs and rare earth magnets with solid execution on price realization, productivity, leverage from higher volumes and synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q2","e":"rrx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"Our second quarter adjusted gross margin was 39.8% or 37.8%, excluding IEEPA tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q2","e":"rrx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"Our second quarter gross margin performance versus prior year, excluding refunds, largely reflects our team's ability to overcome headwinds from a higher-than-anticipated inflation, mix, tariffs and rare earth magnets with leverage from higher volumes and benefits from synergies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q2","e":"rrx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"…refunds, is being driven by 3 factors: one, a longer time line to realize planned productivity gains, in some cases, to prioritize service levels; two, a lag in price realization relative to a faster pace of inflation; three, modest mix impacts related to our revised segment growth outlooks.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q2","e":"rrx","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Rehard","x":"But we are absolutely implementing price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/regal-rexnord-rrx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aamir Paul","x":"One is all our distributed exposure to AI infrastructure build-out, be it the energy markets, cooling infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2026-11-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Aamir Paul","x":"We have never quoted that as data center business, but of course, like most of the economy, it is driven by AI infrastructure build-out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2026-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Our third quarter performance met or exceeded our targets for sales, adjusted EBITDA, and adjusted earnings per share, viewed with and without IEEPA tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2026-11-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Rehard","x":"Turning to margins, our third quarter adjusted gross margin was 37.7%, or 36.8% excluding $14.7 million of IEEPA tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/03/regal-rexnord-rrx-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RRX 2026 Q3","e":"rrx","d":"2026-11-03","l":"pricing_po